              color: Skin.brick,
            ),
          ),
          SizedBox(width: 9),
          Expanded(
            child: Column(
              crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
              children: [
                Text(
                  (n['title'] ?? '').toString(),
                  maxLines: 2,
                  overflow: TextOverflow.ellipsis,
                  style: TextStyle(
                    fontSize: 12,
                    height: 1.25,
                    fontWeight: FontWeight.w700,
                    color: context.ink,
